GaoDrishti AI: Architecture

This document describes the architecture of the GaoDrishti AI digital twin in two parts:

Prototype architecture: what index.html implements today (simulated data, runs in the browser).
Target architecture: the full system planned for the pilot village and beyond.

Both follow the same logical pipeline, so the prototype can be replaced layer by layer without redesigning the system.

