Key behaviors:

A work order is created automatically for every alert shortly after detection. An official can also create one manually from the twin.
Every report goes to both the SDM office and the local office (Pradhan in villages, Nagar Nigam in the Basti), and an SMS goes to villagers.
Closure sends a completion report back to the SDM and an SMS to the citizen who raised it.
