3.1 Simulation layer
Sensor generator: on each tick, every asset's readings drift toward a normal value with small random noise, and the last 40 samples are kept as history.
Fault injector: scenario buttons push readings past thresholds (contaminate water, block a drain, create potholes, fail lights, dry a well, over-pump a borewell, fail a sensor or camera).
Environment toggles: rain, underground flow, and day or night.
